But currently, pressing ArrowRight moves to Saturday? Actually they got observed value ["2026-11-21"] instead of expected ["2026-11-23"]. So moving by one day increments but doesn't skip weekends due to disableDayFn being applied maybe incorrectly?

Let's examine index.html script: They instantiate Pikaday with:
```
disableDayFn: date => date.getDay() === 0 || date.getDay() === 6,
```
That disables Sundays (0) and Saturdays (6).

They also have onDraw setting aria-level.

Now the issue: When focusing the input (#day) and pressing ArrowRight, the Pikaday widget likely handles keydown via `_onKeyChange`. In that handler, cases include:
case 37: subtract 1 day;
case 38: subtract 7 days;
case 39: add 1 day;
case 40: add 7 days;

